          DIGITAL STRENGTHENS APPLICATION, PLATFORM SUPPORT
             FOR COHESION Team/SEE SOFTWARE ENVIRONMENT


MAYNARD, Mass. -- October 18, 1994 -- Digital Equipment Corporation 
today announced a new version of its COHESION Team/SEE UNIX software 
engineering environment with significantly expanded application and 
multiplatform support.  Digital can now deliver leading software 
development and process management products from five major CASE 
vendors with COHESION Team/SEE V1.1.  In addition, Digital offers 
integration support for third party applications in project 
management and desktop publishing.

     Digital also announced that the COHESION Team/SEE environment, 
which runs on the DEC OSF/1 (UNIX) and SunOS operating systems, is 
now available for the HP-UX software platform.

     "Digital is now able to offer companies and development teams 
single-source availability of a robust software engineering 
environment with some of the industry's best tools for enhancing 
productivity, software quality, and process improvement," said Al 
Olsen, manager of Digital's Software Engineering Marketing group.

     "When integrated into the COHESION Team/SEE environment, these 
applications execute transparently on any mixture of the most widely 
used UNIX workstations and servers from Digital, Sun, and  Hewlett-
Packard.  These include Digital's Alpha AXP systems, which are 
recognized as the industry's fastest," Olsen added.

COHESION Team/SEE Applications Listed

     New versions of applications for the COHESION Team/SEE 
environment, available from Digital with Team/SEE EnCASEment 
integration software, include:

     o	Requirements Management, based on Marconi's Requirements & 
     	Traceability Management (RTM);

     o 	Software Analysis and Design, based on Cadre's Teamwork;

     o	Software Analysis and Design, based on Interactive 
        Development Environment's Software through Pictures/Object 
        Modeling Technique;

     o	Software Metrics and Collection and Reporting, based on the 
        Amadeus Measurement System;

     o	Technical Documentation, based on Interleaf 6 for Motif.

     Digital also offers Team/SEE EnCASEment support for the 
AutoPLAN II project management system, from Digital Tool, Inc., and 
for Frame Technology's popular FrameMaker desktop publishing 
software.  The applications themselves are available for purchase 
from their respective vendors.

Manages Multivendor, Multisite Projects

     COHESION Team/SEE consists of a set of workflow and 
configuration management tools and consulting services for managing 
data and development processes for medium-to-large software 
engineering projects spread across multivendor, multisite 
installations.  The COHESION Team/SEE V1.1 environment includes 
the following tools:

     o  Digital's Team/SEE Product Information Tools, which enable 
     	interaction with product information within the Team/SEE 
     	environment;

     o 	SQL Software Ltd.'s PCMS product, the configuration 
        management engine for the Team/SEE environment;

     o 	Digital's Team/SEE Workarea Templates, which tailor the 
        environment with tool-specific icons, rules, and behaviors;

     o 	Digital's Team/SEE Process Assistant, for maintaining 
        user-based "to do" lists with appropriate tools and data for 
        selected tasks;

     o 	Digital's Team/SEE Library Finder, which maintains a list of 
     	published information libraries.

Focus on Efficiency, Improvement

     COHESION Team/SEE products and services focus on process 
efficiency and software product reliability improvement by defining 
the interdependencies of team members and promoting communicaton 
among them. COHESION Team/SEE V1.1 supports creation of development 
processes that meet Level III of the Carnegie-Mellon Software 
Engineering Institute Capability and Maturity Model (SEI-CMM).

     COHESION Team/SEE provides a basic environment to manage the 
full software development lifecycle.  With the COHESIONworX 
client/server tool integration environment as a foundation, COHESION 
Team/SEE extends the development toolset with incremental data and 
project management tools, as well as consulting services.   With the 
sophisticated PCMS configuration management system from SQL Software 
Ltd., COHESION Team/SEE furnishes process and workflow control 
capabilities including support for product requirements management, 
project tracking, quality assurance, organizational process focus, 
and intergroup coordination.

     Licenses for the COHESION Team/SEE V1.1 core package for either 
DEC OSF/1, SunOS, or HP-UX operating systems are priced at $5,500.  
Optional Digital and third-party applications are priced separately.  
All products are currently in shipment.

